  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GCRF/PaCCS: Inter-disciplinary Innovation Awards on Conflict and International Development - PEACE FESTIVAL: Sharing Creative Methodologies for Unearthing Hidden War Stories for Peace</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project proposes to create a space for dialogue on various creative methodologies used to amplify the voices of marginalised peoples in official &apos;truths&apos; following conflict. Benefits local groups, indigenous peoples in Colombia and Peru. SDGs:16</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
